        "translator": "K. M. K. Murthy / Desiraju Hanumanta Rao",
        "text": "That city is sounding with the drumbeats of great drums, and with musical rhythm instruments like mridanga, cymbals, and with string instruments like Veena etc., and on earth she is uniquely the best city. [1-5-18]"
      }
